   "lines": [
    "M. & I took a long tramp",
    "through the woods",
    "stillhunting, but",
    "without success; we",
    "saw nothing except",
    "two or three deer tracks.",
    "Snow lies on the",
    "ground through the",
    "woods, and the small",
    "pools or tarns are all",
    "frozen over.",
    "These pine and",
    "spruce forests, with",
    "their sights & sounds",
    "or more often, absence",
    "of sound, remind me",
    "of the great woods of",
    "Maine and the Adiron-",
    "dacks; they have a",
    "weird, melancholy",
    "fascination for me."
   ],
